OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze at
OL,4,Aformer library
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force advised residents living
OL,7,Fnearby to keep doors and windows closed
OL,8,Fand said road closures were in place at
OL,9,FCauseway and Kingsway.
